{title: Tidewater Lamps}{artist: Fixture Harbour Band}{key: D}# Saved by a classic Mac OS editor: every line ends in a lone carriage return.{start_of_verse: Verse 1}[D]Lamps along the [G]tidewater, [A]burning low[D]Every boat is [Bm]headed home, [G]slow{end_of_verse}{start_of_chorus}[G]Carry me [D]in, [A]carry me [D]in{end_of_chorus}{chorus}